Options:
  --verbose      Print each file as it is read.
  --count <int>  How many times to run.
                 At least one. (required)
  --name <str>
  --dry-run      Show what would change, and change nothing.
  --limit <int>  Stop after this many.
  --label <str>  (required)
Arguments:
  <files>...     The files to read.
